@startuml uc_03_assign_patient
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title F3 Set up Wi-Fi and register the device (REQ-11, REQ-12, REQ-15)
start
if (Wi-Fi credentials stored?) then (no)
 :Device opens a password-protected hotspot;
 :Operator connects with a phone and opens the page;
 :Operator selects the network and enters its password;
 :Device saves the credentials and closes the hotspot;
else (yes)
endif
:Device joins the Wi-Fi;
if (Joined?) then (yes)
 if (Device registered before?) then (no)
  :Device registers on the FHIR server\nand saves its device-id;
 else (yes)
  :Device reuses its saved device-id;
 endif
else (no)
 :Device shows error; listening still works;
 note right: long press (at least 2 s) in Idle\nopens the hotspot page again
endif
stop
floating note
 Patient assignment is a separate
 server workflow outside the MVP.
end note
@enduml
